{
  "_comment": [
    "Clide capture hooks. These POST the hook payload straight to the local daemon.",
    "",
    "type=http, not command: there is no process to spawn, so no Node startup cost per",
    "tool call. Note that `async` is a command-hook-only field and is deliberately absent",
    "here \u2014 an http hook is synchronous, which is safe because the receiver is a local",
    "in-memory server: an absent daemon refuses the connection immediately, and a hung one",
    "is bounded by the explicit timeout below (the platform default is 600s, not a budget).",
    "",
    "The token comes from $CLIDE_TOKEN. If that variable is unset the header interpolates",
    "to an empty string and every event is rejected, so the daemon counts and reports",
    "unauthorized ingest separately from silence. Run `clide install` for the export line.",
    "",
    "SessionStart also runs `hooks/ensure-daemon.sh`, which starts the daemon if it",
    "is not already listening. This is the answer to hook noise: an http hook cannot",
    "fail quietly \u2014 there is no field for it, and `async` is command-hook-only \u2014 so a",
    "daemon that is down turns every tool call into two visible errors. Starting it",
    "here costs one process per SESSION rather than per tool call, and `async: true`",
    "means it never delays a session coming up. CLIDE_NO_AUTOSTART=1 disables it."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": [
              "CLIDE_TOKEN"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/ensure-daemon.sh",
            "async": true,
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": [
              "CLIDE_TOKEN"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": [
              "CLIDE_TOKEN"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": [
              "CLIDE_TOKEN"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Notification": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": [
              "CLIDE_TOKEN"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": [
              "CLIDE_TOKEN"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": [
              "CLIDE_TOKEN"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": [
              "CLIDE_TOKEN"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "http",
            "url": "http://127.0.0.1:47000/hook/claude",
            "timeout": 5,
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "Bearer $CLIDE_TOKEN"
            },
            "allowedEnvVars": [
              "CLIDE_TOKEN"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
